  "summary": "Front fender side louver (the 'gill' / side vent grille behind the front wheel), LH/RH. The louver is held at the top by screws into a clip nut on the fender opening, and at the bottom by its own threaded stud that goes through a retainer and takes a nut. The retainer is riveted to the dash panel extension; a reinforcement is bonded to the fender at the opening. Grille sits .06-.10 recessed in the fender.",
